                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Creating or producing excitement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9509b2a1-721d-4c4f-bd92-b1a937eca237",
                                                "sense_id": "8c5d7dd6-dd98-3ad1-851b-c826fdfe39fa",
                                                "text": "Some of the most exciting games ever played have ended in draws."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f56d122f-001a-3315-a690-81283bca5e6c",
                                        "entry_id": "341733be-a311-35cd-8c9e-87aada705454",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexually stimulating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64753531-ea15-4511-83f1-00fe418fa862",
                                                "sense_id": "f56d122f-001a-3315-a690-81283bca5e6c",
                                                "text": "Among the Turks, an exciting compound consists of olibanum, myrrh, camphor, musk, in pulverized form. The resultant perfume is said to affect the genitals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "exciting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b118f3c6-61d6-327d-8a6b-69f666a7a095",
                                        "entry_id": "15744f44-1091-3604-a13f-5795eb01ae50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of something becoming excited; excitation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c1a10bd-19af-4bda-8128-e314c24be26e",
                                                "sense_id": "b118f3c6-61d6-327d-8a6b-69f666a7a095",
                                                "text": "But parents and masters should make haste in this, as to a great purchase for their children and servants; which while they defer, both sides suffer; the one, in wanting many excitings of grace, the other, in being worse served and obeyed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
